{
  "_comment": "NEVER paste into the chat. Only meant for Nova -- only referenced via her net-config.json, not by Oscar's scripts. Replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE with the real, narrowly scoped Cloudflare API token (My Profile -> API Tokens -> Create Token -> Edit zone DNS template -> restrict Zone Resources to the one domain).",
  "mcpServers": {
    "cloudflare": {
